# FOLLOWER EXPANSION (proof of concept, 2026-09-23): pre-built NSBTX textures copied directly from the
# sibling PokeHeartGold project's own follower asset archive (files/data/mmodel/mmodel/) - these are
# billboard textures for its (fundamentally different, 3D-model-based) follower Pokemon feature, but a
# byte-for-byte header/structure comparison against this project's own pikachu.nsbtx (built via nitrobtx
# from pokemon/pikachu.png, a few lines below) showed IDENTICAL dimension/format fields - both are
# "generic 32x32 billboard" NSBTX textures built to the same shape, just with different pixel content.
# Passed through unmodified (copy_gen, not nitrobtx) specifically to avoid any risk from re-encoding a
# format this project's own tooling didn't produce - see res/graphics/field_sprites/pokemon_hg/ for the
# source files and Changelog.txt for the full investigation.
